        "secretAgenda": "As the spiritual heir to Fergus and Falmouth, Malachai is driven by fanatical zeal. His goal is to eradicate all necromancy (specifically industrial zombie pits), clear the Church's historical record regarding the Period VI child crucifixion scandal and political framing, and locate the lost Fountain of Youth in the Rabirian Mountains to establish a divine totalist theocracy under Nemeth the Gnostic.",
