      "aliases": [
        "Period IV: The Zombie Era",
        "period iv"
      ],
      "summary": "What began as opportunistic greed under Printius and Silkeneth calcified into the economic foundation of the kingdom. Lord Silkeneth's grandson, Edmund—a former scholar of the ruined magical academy—formalized the trade on an industrial scale. Edmund excavated vast, reeking \"zombie pits\" across the capital's periphery and subterranean reaches, systematically raising thousands of thralls to drive underground mining, quarrying, and hazardous construction. The kingdom's wealth soared, built entirely upon the backs of the unquiet dead, while the stench of industrial necromancy settled permanently over the realm.",
      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Chronological Designation:</strong> Period IV: The Zombie Era</p>\n  <p><strong>Core Theme:</strong> Edmund's Industrial Necromancy & Labor Pits</p>\n</div>\n<h3>Historical Chronicle</h3>\n<p>What began as opportunistic greed under Printius and Silkeneth calcified into the economic foundation of the kingdom. Lord Silkeneth's grandson, Edmund—a former scholar of the ruined magical academy—formalized the trade on an industrial scale. Edmund excavated vast, reeking \"zombie pits\" across the capital's periphery and subterranean reaches, systematically raising thousands of thralls to drive underground mining, quarrying, and hazardous construction. The kingdom's wealth soared, built entirely upon the backs of the unquiet dead, while the stench of industrial necromancy settled permanently over the realm.</p>\n\n",
