      "summary": "Last human member of Daedalus's King's Guard (Period V) and Founder of the Church of Nemeth (Period VI).",
      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Historical Role:</strong> Last human member of Daedalus's King's Guard (Period V) and Founder of the Church of Nemeth (Period VI).</p>\n  <p><strong>Period of Prominence:</strong> Period V</p>\n</div>\n<h3>Canonical Actions</h3>\n<p>Recovered the Obsidian Blade and promised to restore Zingara as the magical capital of the world. Instead, he unleashed a zombie army upon Kordava, sacrificing his entire capital to fuel a ritual for personal godhood. When the Starfall meteor disrupted his ritual, his cosmic lover, Tanatos, trapped him in eternal, conscious imprisonment beneath the city rubble for boring her.</p>\n<h3>Lasting Legacy on Modern Zingara</h3>\n<p>Lies buried alive in the rubble beneath The Pit, still holding the Obsidian Blade and bound to his cosmic punishment.</p>\n<p>Fergus</p>\n\n",
