      "content": "\n<div class=\"info-card\">\n  <p><strong>Geographical Type:</strong> Coastal Port / Capital</p>\n  <p><strong>Strategic &amp; Economic Value:</strong> Seat of royal court, foreign trade, naval base.</p>\n  <p><strong>Primary Encounter Hazards:</strong> Court intrigue, royal guards, street skirmishes, assassins.</p>\n</div>\n<h3>Geographical Description</h3>\n<p>The Final Guard: Kalenius's mausoleum is permanently guarded by the Final Guard—one thousand elite ancient Thurian warriors transformed into deathless, animate stone.</p>\n<p>4.2 Interior Fiefs & Agricultural Heartland</p>\n\n<div class=\"gm-callout\">\n  <div class=\"gm-badge\">GM CONFIDENTIAL &bull; REGIONAL HAZARDS &amp; HOOKS</div>\n  <p><strong>Encounter Threats:</strong> Court intrigue, royal guards, street skirmishes, assassins.</p>\n</div>\n",
